content.text:
Understanding the creation of objects is essential.

了解对象的创建对于掌握 JavaScript 是至关重要的。

1. 字面量创建:
```javascript
var John = {
    name: "John",
    age: 25
}
```

2. 构造函数创建:
```javascript
function person (name, age) {
    this.name = name;
    this.age = age;
}
var John = new person("John", 25);
```

